java -cp "$(cat cp.txt)" Repro.java                      # control: 401 in ~330ms
java -cp "$(cat cp.txt)" Repro.java inject-error         # hangs (still blocked after 60s)
java -cp "$(cat cp.txt)" Repro.java inject-error 5000    # "Stream exception in request" after 5s, real Error not in cause chain

# Natural trigger on 9.5.0 (no injection): hangs exactly the same way
cs fetch --classpath com.google.firebase:firebase-admin:9.5.0 \
  --force-version org.apache.httpcomponents.core5:httpcore5:5.3.6 \
  --force-version org.apache.httpcomponents.core5:httpcore5-h2:5.3.6 > cp-950.txt
java -cp "$(cat cp-950.txt)" Repro.java
```

Output with `inject-error` on 9.11.0:

```
Exception in thread "httpclient-dispatch-1" java.lang.LinkageError: simulated Error on the I/O dispatch thread
	at Repro$ThrowingListener.connected(Repro.java:70)
	at org.apache.hc.core5.reactor.InternalDataChannel.onTLSSessionStart(InternalDataChannel.java:184)
