### Proposal Details

A `x509.MustParseOID` function would be useful for initialising OIDs in global variables, in the same vein as [`uuid.MustParse`](https://pkg.go.dev/uuid#MustParse) or [`regexp.MustCompile`](https://pkg.go.dev/regexp#MustCompile).

Sample implementation:

```go
// MustParseOID is like [x509.ParseOID] but panics if the OID cannot be parsed.
func MustParseOID(s string) x509.OID {
	oid, err := x509.ParseOID(s)
	if err != nil {
		panic(err)
	}
	return oid
}
```

